files here originate from the componentjs ecosystem, installed with 'component install',
and then their index.js files are moved here for simple require'ing.

The problem was that
 - npm packages like component-upload had wrong require's in them to be used directly (require('emitter') instead of require('component-emitter'))
 - decomponentify did not work for me

if you have a better way to automatically install components, feel free to do so.
